<%--
Create_Event_Fires_Once - the 'create' lifecycle event fires exactly once per component.

boot_component() used to call component.trigger('create') on top of the trigger already
inside component.create() (audit bug 18), so every subscriber saw it twice.
--%>
<Define:Create_Event_Fires_Once>
  <div>
    <h1>The 'create' event fires exactly once</h1>
    <div $sid="stage"></div>
  </div>
</Define:Create_Event_Fires_Once>
